# Changara Star Academy - Environment Variables

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supabase PostgreSQL (production database)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SUPABASE_URL is a non-secret var set in worker/wrangler.toml.
# The service-role key is a SECRET — set it with:
#
#   cd worker
#   node node_modules/wrangler/bin/wrangler.js secret put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#
# NEVER expose the service-role key in frontend code. RLS is enabled with no
# public policies (see supabase/schema.sql) so only the Worker can access data.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Other Worker secrets (set via `wrangler secret put`)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   JWT_SECRET
#   CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME
#   CLOUDINARY_API_KEY
#   CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# One-time data migration (scripts/migrate-mongodb-to-supabase.js)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://user:pass@cluster0.mongodb.net/csa-school?retryWrites=true&w=majority
# SUPABASE_URL=https://gspikjhqvklixzdnlwhn.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local development (legacy Express server - server.js)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PORT=5000
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://user:pass@cluster0.mongodb.net/csa-school?retryWrites=true&w=majority
JWT_SECRET=your-secret-key-here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional overrides
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
FRONTEND_URL=https://changarastaracademy.co.ke
